        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1811,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, let's ponder our sorrows.",
      "JA_current": "ほう、どんな厄介事か聞いてやろうじゃないか。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1814,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "The situation is as follows: some people are looking for a stalker named Strelok, along with me. I don't know who these people are, but I really want to find out. I know for a fact that they have a man of theirs here in the bar, known only as \"The Agent\". I do not know his real name, maybe you can tell me?",
      "JA_current": "こういう事情だ。俺と同じように、ストレロクというストーカーを追っている連中がいる。そいつらが何者なのかは分からないが、どうしても正体を突き止めたい。確かなのは、連中がこのバーに仲間を潜り込ませているってことだ。そいつは『エージェント』としか呼ばれていない。本名は知らないんだが、あんたなら心当たりがあるんじゃないか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1817,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yeah, that's what it means... To the catcher, as they say... Heh-heh! I wasn't talking to you. As for your question, yes, I think I know who you're talking about. I can tell you, but not for nothing, because nowadays information is of great value. So, if you want to know who this agent is, you can do a job for me.",
      "JA_current": "なるほど、そういうことかい……飛んで火に入る夏の虫、ってな……ヒヒッ！ いや、お前のことじゃないさ。お前の質問だが、ああ、心当たりはあるぜ。教えてやってもいいが、タダとはいかねえ。昨今、情報ってのは何より高値がつくからな。そのエージェントの正体を知りたけりゃ、俺の仕事をひとつ片づけてもらうぜ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1820,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What are the details?",
      "JA_current": "詳しい話を聞かせてくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1823,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Kill a stalker. Neutral. Wanna know why? I'll explain: he witnessed some events that he should not have seen.",
      "JA_current": "あるストーカーを始末しろ。ローナーの奴だ。理由が知りたいか？ 教えてやるよ。そいつはな、見ちゃならねえモンを目撃しちまったのさ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1826,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Sounds like a dirty job!",
      "JA_current": "汚れ仕事のようだな！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent",
          "phrase_id": "6",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_8#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1829,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_8",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Don't worry, you can put your moral principles aside. Just to put your sensitive conscience at ease, I happen to know that this stalker is a scumbag, and many would like him dead, so killing him can be considered a good deed around here. And one more thing: be sure to bring me proof of his death: some personal thing, for example. Otherwise, no deal.",
      "JA_current": "心配すんな、道徳だの倫理観なんざ路地裏にでも捨てておけ。お前の繊細なお良心を安心させてやるために言っとくが、そいつは正真正銘の人間のクズでな、死んで万々歳の連中が山ほどいる。殺したところで、ここじゃ善行とすら称えられるぜ。それともう一つ、そいつが死んだ確たる証拠を持ってくるんだ。身につけてる遺品なんかでいい。証拠がなけりゃ取引はナシだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent",
          "phrase_id": "7",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_9#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1832,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_about_agent_phrase_9",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "So be it, I agree.",
      "JA_current": "いいだろう、引き受けた。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
